{"name": "cowtastic_cafe", "game": "Cowtastic Cafe", "version": "0.0.0", "hidden": false, "groups": [{"name": "Game Options", "options": [{"name": "progression_balancing", "display_name": "Progression Balancing", "description": "A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "NamedRange", "default": 50, "min": 0, "max": 99, "presets": {"disabled": 0, "normal": 50, "extreme": 99}}, {"name": "accessibility", "display_name": "Accessibility", "description": "Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Choice", "default": 0, "choices": [{"name": "full", "display_name": "Full", "value": 0}, {"name": "minimal", "display_name": "Minimal", "value": 2}]}, {"name": "starting_ingredients", "display_name": "Starting Ingredients", "description": "Which ingredients you begin the run with already unlocked (precollected).\nValid values are the purchasable ingredients: Espresso, Coffee, Chocolate,\nTea, Milk, Cream, Sugar, Ice, Boba, Sprinkles, Whipped Cream, Caramel Sauce,\nCocoa Powder. (Breast Milk is always available and cannot be listed here.)\nAt least one 'base' ingredient \u2014 one a drink can actually be built on\n(Espresso, Coffee, Chocolate, Tea, Milk, or Cream) \u2014 MUST be included, or no\norder can be fulfilled and generation fails. Sugar, Ice, Boba, and the other\ningredients are add-ons only; they are never a drink's base, so a start made\nof just those is invalid. Defaults to Milk + Coffee.", "randomizable": false, "visibility": 15, "type": "OptionSet", "default": ["Milk", "Coffee"], "options": ["Boba", "Caramel Sauce", "Chocolate", "Cocoa Powder", "Coffee", "Cream", "Espresso", "Ice", "Milk", "Sprinkles", "Sugar", "Tea", "Whipped Cream"]}, {"name": "drinks_per_check", "display_name": "Drinks Per Check", "description": "How many drinks with each ingredient you must serve to earn one check.\nExample: with 3 drinks per check and 3 checks per ingredient,\nchecks fire when you've served 3, 6, and 9 drinks with that ingredient.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 3, "min": 1, "max": 20}, {"name": "checks_per_ingredient", "display_name": "Checks Per Ingredient", "description": "How many location checks exist per ingredient (14 ingredients have serve\nchecks: the 13 unlockable ones plus always-available Breast Milk).\nAt the default of 4, with 10 shop slots, all cosmetics fit in the pool with\nroom to spare. More than that pads the game out with filler; fewer checks\nper ingredient will triage away cosmetics (and then useful items).\nMinimum 2: below that the mandatory items don't fit (14*2 + 10 = 38 >= 31).", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 4, "min": 2, "max": 10}, {"name": "shop_locations", "display_name": "Shop Locations", "description": "How many shop location checks exist across the run.\nThe in-game shop shows the next 6 unpurchased slots at a time;\nbuying one sends a check and reveals the next slot in the queue.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 10, "min": 0, "max": 50}, {"name": "extra_candy", "display_name": "Extra Candy", "description": "Additional Stretchy Candy (milk-capacity upgrades) added to the pool\nbeyond the amount required to win. The goal is the in-game 'barista\noverflows' good end; in Arcade mode 19 candy are required to grow the\nbarista enough to trigger it. Extras are a buffer and let you keep growing\npast the requirement.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 1, "min": 0, "max": 30}, {"name": "milk_flow", "display_name": "Milk Flow Increases", "description": "How many 'Milk Flow Increase' items are in the pool. Each one raises the\nbarista's actual milk production rate. Set to 0 to have none.\nNote: useful and cosmetic items are only added until locations are filled, so\nhigh values here combined with low check counts may result in fewer items\nbeing placed than requested.\nAlso note: There is currently no way to lower this flow once received. Only\nplay with the max flow you're willing to play with.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 5, "min": 0, "max": 20}, {"name": "shop_base_price", "display_name": "Shop Base Price", "description": "Starting price (in coins) for the first shop slot.\nLogic gating uses slot position, not actual price, so changing this only\naffects in-game cost, not item accessibility.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 50, "min": 10, "max": 100}, {"name": "shop_price_step", "display_name": "Shop Price Step", "description": "How much each subsequent shop slot costs compared to the previous one.\nSlot N costs base + step*(N-1), capped at 550.\nLogic gating is based on slot position (every 2 slots = 1 more ingredient\nrequired), so changing this only affects in-game cost.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 25, "min": 5, "max": 50}, {"name": "min_drink_quality", "display_name": "Minimum Drink Quality", "description": "Minimum drink rating required to earn a serve-location check.\nPerfect is the strictest; Okay is the most lenient.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Choice", "default": 2, "choices": [{"name": "perfect", "display_name": "Perfect", "value": 0}, {"name": "great", "display_name": "Great", "value": 1}, {"name": "good", "display_name": "Good", "value": 2}, {"name": "okay", "display_name": "Okay", "value": 3}]}, {"name": "death_link", "display_name": "Death Link", "description": "When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Toggle", "default": false}, {"name": "death_link_send_quality", "display_name": "DeathLink Send Quality", "description": "When DeathLink is enabled, serving a drink rated at this quality or\nworse sends a death to all DeathLink participants. Ratings run from best to\nworst: Great, Good, Okay, Meh, Bad, Ruined. (Perfect is excluded \u2014 it can\nnever be a death trigger.)", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Choice", "default": 4, "choices": [{"name": "great", "display_name": "Great", "value": 1}, {"name": "good", "display_name": "Good", "value": 2}, {"name": "okay", "display_name": "Okay", "value": 3}, {"name": "meh", "display_name": "Meh", "value": 4}, {"name": "bad", "display_name": "Bad", "value": 5}, {"name": "ruined", "display_name": "Ruined", "value": 6}]}, {"name": "death_link_penalty", "display_name": "DeathLink Penalty", "description": "How much happiness the barista loses when a DeathLink is received\nfrom another player. 0 = no effect; 100 = full happiness wipe.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Range", "default": 20, "min": 0, "max": 100}, {"name": "censorship_mode", "display_name": "Censorship Mode", "description": "Hide the mod's lewd item/location names from the multiworld. Purely a\nnaming/display change \u2014 there is NO effect on gameplay, logic, IDs, or which\nitems go where. When on:\n  - 'Serve Breast Milk #n' locations become 'Serve Secret Ingredient #n'\n  - cosmetics become 'Cosmetic Top/Pants/Extra #n'\n  - the 'Milk Flow Increase' item becomes 'Supply Rate Increase'\nPer-slot: only your slot's names are censored in the spoiler/trackers; other\nplayers' Cowtastic slots are unaffected by your setting.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Toggle", "default": false}, {"name": "allow_milk_rate_adjustment", "display_name": "Allow Milk Rate Adjustment", "description": "Let the player manually control the milk production rate. When on, the two\nleft-hand shop buttons return to being milk-rate up/down controls (free to\nuse, in 5 ml steps); the other four buttons remain randomizer shop slots.\nThe rate floor stays at 1 step (5 ml); the ceiling is (items received + 1)\nsteps, so each 'Milk Flow Increase' item both raises the cap AND bumps the\ncurrent rate up one notch (the first item already grants headroom above the\nfloor). Purely a client-side control change; no effect on generation,\nlogic, or item placement.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Toggle", "default": false}, {"name": "scout_shop", "display_name": "Scout Shop", "description": "Automatically create scout hints for the randomizer shop's contents, so\nyou (and the item owners) can see what each shop slot will hand out without\nspending hint points.\n  - none:    no shop scouting.\n  - visible: hint only the shop slots currently on display (the cheapest\n             unpurchased ones); as you buy and new slots surface, they're\n             hinted too.\n  - all:     hint every shop slot up front.\nPurely a client-side hint convenience; no effect on generation, logic, or\nitem placement.", "randomizable": true, "visibility": 15, "type": "Choice", "default": 1, "choices": [{"name": "none", "display_name": "None", "value": 0}, {"name": "visible", "display_name": "Visible", "value": 1}, {"name": "all", "display_name": "All", "value": 2}]}], "collapsed": false}, {"name": "Item & Location Options", "options": [{"name": "local_items", "display_name": "Local Items", "description": "Forces these items to be in their native world.", "randomizable": false, "visibility": 15, "type": "OptionSet", "default": [], "options": ["Ingredient: Espresso", "Ingredient: Coffee", "Ingredient: Chocolate", "Ingredient: Tea", "Ingredient: Milk", "Ingredient: Cream", "Ingredient: Sugar", "Ingredient: Ice", "Ingredient: Boba", "Ingredient: Sprinkles", "Ingredient: Whipped Cream", "Ingredient: Caramel Sauce", "Ingredient: Cocoa Powder", "Stretchy Candy", "Fullness Tolerance", "Happiness Upgrade", "